{
  "tieba_9340331265": {
    "title": "桂月昌华。",
    "type": "月季",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "终于是成熟了睿智了，对这种大红花爱不释手。几个月前入的，刚开几朵，红花黄蕊墨绿叶片很古雅端正的搭配。大概14cm左右，看了下新枝稍都在长小花苞。比一季品种长势快很多。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/175fb3d18e20158731f2c33a0b21cab8.webp"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/03c4e2d668d9058e996062e5f7d27211.webp"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/c58ade1d113181b71977d415005393ce.webp"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/12d07dabf7d4c5bae40c0a337265f2ae.webp"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/5b6e9b2db061efcdd1e8a376402c520e.webp"
      }
    ],
    "author": {
      "name": "竹子竹子竹子🌿",
      "avatar": "https://gss0.bdstatic.com/6LZ1dD3d1sgCo2Kml5_Y_D3/sys/portrait/item/tb.1.8037631b.GkWA71ufjFdWiAxXDQB5Hg?t=1779722248",
      "url": "https://tieba.baidu.com/home/main?id=tb.1.8037631b.GkWA71ufjFdWiAxXDQB5Hg%3Ft%3D1779722248"
