  "tieba_8296411753": {
    "title": "白vvvvv",
    "type": "月季",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "第4个月，香气比以前浓了很多。近闻柠檬茶味，远点就只能闻到红茶香。"
      },
      {
        "t": "第4个月，香气比以前浓了很多。近闻柠檬茶味，远点就只能闻到红茶香。"
      },
      {
        "t": "素净而优雅"
      },
      {
        "t": "好美，我那小苗苗啥时候能养大"
      },
      {
        "t": "长得很快的，我这棵也就养了四个月，刚开始就一光杆牙签"
      },
      {
        "t": "vavavava"
      },
      {
        "t": "就说这小卷边精不精致"
      },
      {
        "t": "好漂亮"
      },
      {
        "t": "话说我觉得月季的茶香都是红茶"
      },
      {
        "t": "确实。茶叶里好像也只有红茶类有统一的红茶刻板气味，绿茶普洱之类的乱七八糟啥味都有。\"\n\n\nawait page.evaluate('() => (Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\\'.pb-content-wrap, .pb-text-wrapper, .d_post_content, [class*=post-content], [class*=reply-content]\\')).map(e=>e.innerText.trim()).filter(t=>t.length>0).join(\\'"
      },
      {
        "t": "\\'))');"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/0f7685629e1da8d36b2f7087afe0ed0d.webp"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://tiebapic.baidu.com/forum/pic/item/17db02db81cb39db3c4abd9e95160924aa183015.jpg?tbpicau=2026-06-10-05_f0fe98b69775b9c12c96e8fc4ef0003d"
      }
    ],
    "author": {
      "name": "竹子竹子竹子🌿",
      "avatar": "https://gss0.bdstatic.com/6LZ1dD3d1sgCo2Kml5_Y_D3/sys/portrait/item/tb.1.8037631b.GkWA71ufjFdWiAxXDQB5Hg?t=1779722267",
      "url": "https://tieba.baidu.com/home/main?id=tb.1.8037631b.GkWA71ufjFdWiAxXDQB5Hg%3Ft%3D1779722267"
    },
    "time": "2023-03-06 09:31",
