  "tieba_8220479437": {
    "title": "几个月没管的假粉",
    "type": "月季",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "这个株型"
      },
      {
        "t": "这个株型"
      },
      {
        "t": "白薇。三个半月才长满一加仑，根系也刚从出水孔冒出来了。株型太直耸了，和预想的差别有点大。。"
      },
      {
        "t": "谢特。。又冒笋了，控养失败。等看几波春花秋天还是换品种吧"
      },
      {
        "t": "仔细一看腋芽还都萌发了"
      },
      {
        "t": "也太小了，假粉可以变成一个球"
      },
      {
        "t": "小盆栽比较有折腾的乐趣"
      },
      {
        "t": "放养精养间隔着来爆花的时候就很有成就感"
      },
      {
        "t": ":这倒是实话。你多发点这类。我觉得能小盆的都不错。"
      },
      {
        "t": ":秋天才能入苗。到时候多入几个小型茶盆栽玩玩。\"\n\n\nawait page.evaluate('() => (Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\\'.pb-content-wrap, .pb-text-wrapper, .d_post_content, [class*=post-content], [class*=reply-content]\\')).map(e=>e.innerText.trim()).filter(t=>t.length>0).join(\\'"
      },
      {
        "t": "\\'))');"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/2a4c47ec4e20a95b5fb5a546ca32e731.webp"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://tiebapic.baidu.com/forum/pic/item/2cd228889e510fb32b4323529c33c895d0430cb9.jpg?tbpicau=2026-06-10-05_ddcf0bc510653162735f429b0a1cd25b"
      }
    ],
    "author": {
      "name": "竹子竹子竹子🌿",
      "avatar": "https://gss0.bdstatic.com/6LZ1dD3d1sgCo2Kml5_Y_D3/sys/portrait/item/tb.1.8037631b.GkWA71ufjFdWiAxXDQB5Hg?t=1779722283",
      "url": "https://tieba.baidu.com/home/main?id=tb.1.8037631b.GkWA71ufjFdWiAxXDQB5Hg%3Ft%3D1779722283"
    },
    "time": "2023-01-14 03:46",
