  "tieba_6241713907": {
    "title": "【原来如此】前辈们的随意起名误导了我们",
    "type": "月季",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "凯瑟琳莫利镇楼"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/3916108bc4f0032138e71dc0e7fd793f.webp"
      },
      {
        "t": "一直在疑惑，有些月季看起来并不是很像古老月季，但是却又有古老月季的名字，今天看了杨百荔、朱秀珍等几位老师主编的《月季花》，疑惑得到了解答，比如我们现在所说的“映日荷花”原来它的原名叫日辉，英文名叫Radiance，1908年由J Cook培育，前两张图说明了映日荷花名字的由来，后几张是我从网站上找到Radiance的图片，可以看出，它就是我们说的映日荷花"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/39d485e62e7cc98e97436869d1960e8b.webp"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/1549979c9381febfd125d8b01c084a44.webp"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/2d725fa8d0df8695de93b198994ca2d4.webp"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/a5b4e6136e335565e39c7d290a60d4e0.webp"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/27926e5a365bfb094357c7d2dca8e0b6.webp"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/4206f33bb70618f76cf0c7626aba18f9.webp"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/be5e9eafb403a4df9523f05d4364bbb8.webp"
      },
      {
        "t": "同理，还有紫香云，香紫红香紫红、（紫绒可能就是从这几个紫xx里演变出来的名字）墨绒等等，原来都是因为以前它们刚刚引进到国内时，人们没有按照它们的原名翻译，而是自己起了名字，后来，我们看这名字古色古香的，就以为是中国古老月季了"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/b018b563fd4152e8937c696ef7ebd47e.webp"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/a54318c6f0710cd52d2d02c7c9f2fcbc.webp"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/ab898ad595cf9caf5ef2007a14cef305.webp"
      }
    ],
    "author": {
      "name": "天真的小小之歌",
      "avatar": "https://gss0.bdstatic.com/6LZ1dD3d1sgCo2Kml5_Y_D3/sys/portrait/item/tb.1.b7cba5f3.UUIj7DxtOUV1ASribNyuhg?t=1779722553",
      "url": "https://tieba.baidu.com/home/main?id=tb.1.b7cba5f3.UUIj7DxtOUV1ASribNyuhg%3Ft%3D1779722553"
